{"id":402602011,"chapter_id":50070,"scene_id":57006,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"临时背景等资源","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"【空场】【循环动态背景或者一个循环模糊特效，让背景有点微动即可】【丰富音效】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"你动弹不得。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"眼前一切像真实，又很虚幻。不论是刚刚激烈的冲突，还是此刻空旷的平静都像梦一样。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"而你感觉被看不见的沉重透明玻璃碾压成薄片，手脚挪动不了半分，只能瞪大眼睛看刺目的白光。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"选项","options":["动一下"],"jump":[7],"style":6,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"【空场】点击一下画面就模糊一次感觉让人很难受。","style":18,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"你还是没办法做出任何动作。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"选项","options":["呼唤同伴"],"jump":[10],"style":6,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"无人回应。远处传来像人声又不像人声的怪诞声音，你听不懂它们的语言。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"远处的声音","content":"菠菜！贱卖！菠菜！贱卖！三斤卖十块不看白不看！菠菜！贱卖！贱卖！","voice":["vo_event_402602011_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"【信息爆炸】轻微的变形，一切都在晃动、变化、眼睛被晃花了，难受","style":18,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"声音强行封住耳朵，宛如进了黑环一般令你窒息。你想起自己手头唯一的武器——","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"选项","options":["释放枷锁"],"jump":[15],"style":6,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"【剧烈花屏震动最终黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"晃动的视野终于稳定，光影不再乱晃，耳鸣消减，除了背后的世界看起来有些微妙的不同，一切总算回归你熟悉的感官认知。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"就连罪魁祸首也回到她该有的位置，笑眯眯看着你。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"000","content":"好点了吗？神的世界维度太高，信息过载，以你现在的纸片儿身子肯定承受不了。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"000","content":"所以我把你收进这个小手机，再调成你熟悉的低次元模式。这样你就好受多了。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"她嘿嘿笑着，视野也跟着微微晃动——你怀疑她是转了个圈儿。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"000","content":"来，看看我的新造型怎么样？还有修改空间，给点意见？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"000","content":"声音呢？喜欢吗？我唱个小曲给你听？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"content":"她看起来心情好得不行，跟出笼的鸟一样，这愈发让你感觉她之前的表现全是装的。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"周围没有任何熟悉人的身影，就算是空间转移这儿也绝不是狄斯城。尽管噪声得到压制，但你隐约还能听到一些声音。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"这里不是梦，不是黑环，是另一个超出你认知的世界。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"选项","options":["到底怎么回事"],"jump":[28],"style":6,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"什么神的世界？这里到底是哪儿，你怎么把我绑架过来的，你到底有什么目的？","style":2,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"狄斯城现在怎么样了，我的同伴呢？","style":2,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"000","content":"这就想家啦？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"000","content":"喏，游戏的入口现在就在你手机里，想家的话可以随时看看。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"【一段gltichbug的表演】【画面浑浊，鬼哭狼嚎】","style":18,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"混沌的人声","content":"救命啊——滋滋滋——谁来、谁来救救我——这都是些啥啊啊啊——局长——滋滋——局长你在哪儿？（系统出现）大崩溃……滋滋……（污染极速）扩张……是暗网吗，还是……滋滋…………","voice":["vo_event_402602011_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"前所未有的紊乱信息瞬间充斥着你所在的夹缝空间，你瞬间清醒，随即感到空前的恐慌，想立刻冲进这团混乱回到大家身边。","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"但你被硬生生拽了回来。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"000","content":"好啦那边出了点BUG，暂时回不去。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"000","content":"等我们把正事干完，问题就解决了。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"选项","options":["那边出什么事了？你做了什么？"],"jump":[42],"style":6,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"speaker":"000","content":"呵呵，我能做什么呀？不是说了么，能改变世界的是神啊。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"选项","options":["……你去找“神”了？"],"jump":[44],"style":6,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"content":"这话问出来，你自己都觉得荒谬。可她眼底的疯狂让你无法把这一切仅仅当作玩笑。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"speaker":"000","content":"对，你过来水土不服昏迷太久。在你醒来前，我就先去拜见了其中几位神大人。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"speaker":"选项","options":["你让它们做了什么？"],"jump":[47],"style":6,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"speaker":"000","content":"让它做什么？哈哈哈哈，我又不是去求神祈祷的。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"speaker":"000","content":"我把它们都杀了。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"content":"她伸出手，手中悬浮着两串怪异的符号。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"speaker":"000","content":"喏，这就是神的力量，转移的时候可能没注意，不小心折腾了游戏里的大家，我向你道歉，原谅我吧？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"speaker":"000","content":"现在还只有两个。等收集齐了，我们就让一切恢复原状。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":52,"speaker":"000","content":"哦不对，到那时就能主宰整个游戏，你来当新世界的神。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"speaker":"000","content":"嗯，就这么定了，走吧！","voice":["vo_event_402602011_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":54,"content":"她带着手机就要离开。你感到一阵失重，加速感令人反胃，不禁更紧张起来。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":55,"speaker":"选项","options":["放开！"],"jump":[56],"style":6,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":56,"speaker":"000","content":"唉唉我的小祖宗，又怎么了？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":58,"speaker":"000","content":"这是？！","voice":["vo_event_402602011_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":1,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":59,"content":"又一阵剧烈的震荡，你眼前一花，人好像被打碎成无数小方块，瞬间被抽离小小的手机壳子，脱离了000的掌心，你被甩进一条光怪陆离的隧道。","style":3,"background":2275,"log_type":1},{"step":60,"content":"无数光点数字冲刷着你，随即——","style":3,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":61,"content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44>- 通信 自 5732 -</color></size>","style":14,"background":10115,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":62,"speaker":"干扰音","content":"局长？${PlayerName}局长？？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":63,"speaker":"干扰音","content":"通信肯定接通了，你听见了就回句话，一堆人急着找呢。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":64,"content":"这个声音是——","style":3,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":65,"speaker":"选项","options":["瑞思？"],"jump":[66],"style":6,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":66,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"是我，幸好你还活着。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":67,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"你被裂隙吞噬后了过去了16小时，连禁闭者的枷锁都感应不到你的存在，情况到底——","voice":["vo_event_402602011_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":68,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"局长————快回来啊家里乱套了——","voice":["vo_event_402602011_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":69,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"局子里好多怪物我看什么都有重影，箭都射不准……我*天上还飞过一只哥■拉啊啊啊！！","voice":["vo_event_402602011_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":70,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长你还好吗？没受伤吧？你在哪里？周围有危险吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":71,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"当时你被裂隙吞没了，如果我们穿过裂隙，能到你身边支援你吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":72,"content":"听到熟悉的声音，你心里一热，终于还是克制了诉说的冲动，眼下你要比她们更冷静才行。","style":3,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":73,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"冷静点，这裂隙很诡异，你们来了不知道还会出什么状况。我目前还算安全，大家先别冲动涉险。","style":2,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":74,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"另外，你们怎么联系到我的？能告诉我大概情况吗？","style":2,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":75,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"联系你的是……","voice":["vo_event_402602011_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":76,"content":"（哒哒哒的声音，摔倒的音效）","style":18,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":77,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"呀！烫烫烫……","voice":["vo_event_402602011_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":78,"speaker":"谁呀，这么晚了还在打电话。","content":"呜……我的咖啡，还有报告……","voice":["vo_event_402602011_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":79,"content":"听上去像是摔倒了，对面传来一阵慌乱的声音。","style":3,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":80,"speaker":"选项","options":["你是……？"],"jump":[81],"style":6,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":81,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯？局长在么？哦对，你还看不到这边的情况，需要视频功能吗？嗯……ok开发完成，来视频吧局长。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":82,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"哎不对，我这幅样子也太——","voice":["vo_event_402602011_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":83,"content":"又是一阵慌乱，一阵新数据流汇聚到你身侧形成一片屏幕，白光一闪——","style":3,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":84,"content":"【摔倒CG，下面这个cg不想描述迷糊样了，快点进入】","style":18,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":85,"content":"视频确实是接通了，但眼前的情景让你措手不及。","style":3,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":86,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"啊哈哈……局长你好呀，让你见笑了，熬夜追踪太久，我也有点犯迷糊了。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":87,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我是摩尔，瑞思的同事，涅槃网络安全中心的技术员，负责大多数网络安全工作，最近也常处理狄斯暗网相关的需求。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":88,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"对了，极乐岛事件我也参与过，您还记得吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":89,"speaker":"选项","options":["记得","……抱歉"],"jump":[90,92],"style":6,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":90,"content":"摩尔，是涅槃集团网络安全技术中心的负责人，在灰镜和极乐岛事件都为MBCC提供了关键支援，但之前你们并未直接沟通过，你也是最近才在资料中看到她的资料。","style":3,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":92,"content":"你隐约记得当时是有位专家协助破解极乐岛安全系统，装了后门让你自由出入。","style":3,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":93,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"呵呵，能帮到你就好了。我们也算有过愉快的合作，这一次也请你多多指教多多包涵。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":94,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"等你回来，出来喝个咖啡吧？我很早就听人说过关于你的很多事，一直想见你一面呢。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":95,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"等事情结束后再闲聊吧。摩尔小姐，既然已经找到人了，你有办法把局长带回来吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602011_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":96,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"外面的情况已经很糟糕了，我们很需要他。","female_content":"外面的情况已经很糟糕了，我们很需要她。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_113","vo_event_402602011_113f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":97,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"哎呀呀抱歉，连续通宵，神经有些过度兴奋了。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":98,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"现在立刻带你回来还有些困难，我需要花时间解码两个世界间的壁垒。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":99,"speaker":"选项","options":["……没关系"],"jump":[100],"style":6,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":100,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我对那个禁闭者说的“刺杀神明”非常在意。你有办法送我去现场吗？","style":2,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":101,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你摔倒了坐在地上都能几秒钟开发出异世界通信视频，我绝对相信你。","style":2,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":102,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"呵呵，没问题，已经准备好了。我就知道你会提出这样的需求。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":103,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我们大概都有预感，要解决狄斯城的问题，还需要局长在那边努力。","voice":["vo_event_402602011_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26201","style":11,"background":4319,"log_type":1},{"step":104,"content":"信号另一端的女人温柔笑着。她将成为你探索新世界的信标。","style":3,"background":4319,"log_type":1}]}